### META
directory_path: install/_webui.sh/backend/sections/services
description: Web-UI backend for Swarm Services management per PART 9
created: 2025-11-29
modified: 2025-11-29
status: active

### FILES
section.json | Section metadata (id, title, order, etc.)
routes.py | Flask blueprint with API routes

### API_ENDPOINTS
GET /api/services/list | List all defined services
GET /api/services/<n> | Get service details and descriptor
POST /api/services/<n>/build | Build service image
POST /api/services/<n>/deploy | Deploy service to swarm
POST /api/services/<n>/remove | Remove service from swarm
GET /api/services/<n>/logs | Get service logs
GET /api/services/<n>/status | Get deployment status
GET /api/services/<n>/check | Run service diagnostics

### DEPENDENCIES
Flask | Web framework
PyYAML | For parsing service.yaml files
dinser CLI | For build/deploy operations
